timestamp=2026-11-05T12:53:09.491Z level=INFO run=3351243d message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Mix of encodings. Let us write a small loader that tries both.\nimport pandas as pd\n\ndef read_prod(path):\n    # try encodings\n    with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n        raw = f.read(2)\n    encodings = []\n    if raw.startswith(b'\\xff\\xfe') or raw.startswith(b'\\xfe\\xff'):\n        encodings = ['utf-16le', 'utf-16be']\n    else:\n        encodings = ['utf-8', 'utf-16le', 'utf-16be', 'latin-1']\n    for enc in encodings:\n        try:\n            df = pd.read_csv(path, sep=None, engine='python', skiprows=3, encoding=enc)\n            return df, enc\n        except Exception as e:\n            last = e\n    raise last\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
